hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan in today's  episode I'm going to answer a question  from one of my youtube viewers Michael  who wrote in asking if it's worth  getting a higher degree of education and  if that would help him sell more to his  customers because they see him more as  an authority so Michael there's a number  of reasons to go and get higher  education I don't think it would really  help you with your customers so if you  wanted to learn the knowledge that's  great if you want to make more  connections get more experience and  maybe that would be a good reason to do  it but in terms of being able to sell  your customers because you have a degree  I don't think that's really going to  help you much in most situations as a  quick example my first company that did  well was a biotech software company and  I was in charge of sales those 19 years  old I was in University just doing an  undergrad program and we were selling to  universities we were selling to NASA and  johnson Johnson as well big corporations  and we were selling software to  researchers so you think they would care  a lot about you know who's selling this  stuff but it never really came up like  they care about the results customers  care about results not so much about the  prestige of who's selling them so I  don't think that's really going to make  an impact in terms of you be able to  sell more customers they're going to  care about your ability to deliver what  you say you're going to do there are  other reason to go out and get the  education again if you're looking for  those skills look at the improve your  knowledge you're going to make  connections in the industry then those  could be reasons but I wouldn't do it  just to add more prestige for selling  more to customers so I hope that helps  Michael I'd love to hear what you guys  have to think if you agree or disagree  with me please leave a comment below if  you like the video please give it a  thumbs up those things always make me  want to make more videos and add some no  excitement to my day so thank you for  that and we'll see you in the next  episode  you
 

